			<p class="open">Admission ends 30 mins.<br>before closing time.</p><p class="sunset"><span>TODAY’S SUNSET TIME</span><strong id="sunset_time"></strong></p>			<!--<p class="preparation">Shimane Art Museum is closed<br> for renovations.<span>*The museum will reopen in May 2022 [planned]</span></p>-->
