	<section class="information-sec">
		<div class="contents">
			<h2 id="information" class="heading00"><span class="pc">Information</span><img class="sp" src="../../images/en/information.svg" alt="Information"></h2>
			<h3 class="heading01 mt80 smt70">Opening Hours</h3>
			<p class="mt24 smt24">
				October - February&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br class="sp">10:00 - 18:30<br>
				March - September&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br class="sp">10:00 - 30minutes after sunset<br>
				(Admission ends 30 mins. before closing time)
			</p>
			<p class="mt32 bt mb0 smt70"><a href="https://www.shimane-art-museum.jp/upload/sunset.pdf" class="com-bt pdf" target="_blank">Sunset Schedule</a></p>
			<h3 class="heading01 mt80 smt90">Closed</h3>
			<p class="mt24 smt24">
				Tuesdays and December 28 - January 1<br>
				(when a national holiday falls on Tuesday, the museum is open and is closed on the following day)
			</p>
			<p class="asterisk s12 en"><span>Closed days may change according to the schedule of the special exhibitions</span></p>
			<p class="mt32 bt mb0 smt70"><a href="https://www.shimane-art-museum.jp/upload/calendar.pdf" class="com-bt pdf" target="_blank">Calendar</a></p>
			<h3 class="heading01 mt80 smt90">Access</h3>
			<ul class="list-dot mt24">
				<li>15 minute walk from JR Matsue Station.</li>
				<li>City bus ‘minamijunkansen(82 Uchi)’ from JR Matsue Station(Bus stop No.1) to “Kenritsu bijutsukan-mae”(about 6 mins.)</li>
				<li>City loop bus ‘lake line’ to “Kenritsu bijutsukan-mae”</li>
				<li>5 minute drive from Sanin Expressway(Matsue-nishi off-ramp)</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="mt24 mb0 img smt40"><img class="aligncenter" src="../../images/en/map.svg" width="790" alt="map"></p>
			<h3 class="heading01 mt80 smt90">Parking</h3>
			<p class="mt24 smt24">
				Operating Hours&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8:00 - 21:30<br>
				Parking Fees&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;free for first 3 hours
			</p>
			<h3 class="heading01 mt80 smt90">Admission</h3>
			<p class="mt24 smt24">
				Museum Collection<br>
				Figures in parentheses show the group admission fee of 20 people or more
			</p>
			<table class="table border short mt40 not-table">
				<tr class="pc">
					<td></td>
					<td>Museum Collection </td>
				</tr>
				<tr class="sp">
					<th colspan="2"><strong>Museum Collection</strong></th>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>Adults</td>
					<td>400 (320)yen</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>College students</td>
					<td>260 (200)yen</td>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<td>High school students and younger</td>
					<td>Free</td>
				</tr>
			</table>
			<ul class="list-dot mt24 smt50">
				<li>If you see both the collection and special exhibitions on the same day, admission of the collection will be half price.</li>
				<li>Viewing is free for visitors with a certificate of physical disability, rehabilitation, or mental disability; chaperons are also free.</li>
			</ul>
			<h3 class="heading01 mt80 smt90">Artwork Commentary Service</h3>
			<p class="mt24 smt24">
				Using the smartphone application “Pocket Curator,” commentary of the museum and around 120 artworks is available.<br>
				There is support for Japanese, English, Chinese and Korean. Audio guides are also available in Japanese and English.
			</p>
			<p class="asterisk s12 en"><span>The app “Pocket Curator” is required for this service. <br>Please download the application from the following site.</span></p>
			<p class="mt32 bt mb0 smt70"><a href="https://welcome.mapps.ne.jp/pocket" target="_blank" class="com-bt link">Developer's site</a></p>
			<h3 class="heading01 mt80 smt90">Contact</h3>
			<p class="mt24 smt24">
				Shimane Art Museum<br>
				1-5 Sodeshi-cho, Matsue-shi, Shimane-ken 690-0049<br>
				TEL: 81-852-55-4700 (Operator) ／FAX: 81-852-55-4714<br>
				https://www.shimane-art-museum.jp
			</p>
			<p class="mt32 bt mb0 smt70"><a href="https://ssl1.suntory.co.jp/apl/btcr/cp/SPSSHIMANE01/form" class="com-bt link">Contact us</a></p>
		</div>
